        "id": 1,
        "title": "The Little Bookshop",
        "title_cn": "雨天的小书店",
        "content": "It was a rainy afternoon. Lily walked into a small bookshop near the park. The room was warm, and the shelves were full of books.\nAn old man smiled at her. “Are you looking for a story?” he asked. Lily nodded. He gave her a book with a blue cover.\nShe sat by the window and began to read. Outside, the rain grew quiet. Inside, Lily found a new world.",
        "content_cn": "那是一个下雨的午后。莉莉走进了公园附近的一家小书店。屋子里很温暖，书架上摆满了书。\n一位老人向她微笑。“你在找故事吗？”他问道。莉莉点了点头。他递给她一本蓝色封面的书。\n她坐在窗边，开始阅读。窗外的雨渐渐变小了。屋子里，莉莉发现了一个新的世界。"
      }
